{"candidateAnswer":"Taking them for walks, watching them, feeding them fruits and vegetables, giving them baths, and bringing them to the beach.","evidence":"[D25:21 | 8:16 pm on 25 October, 2022] Nate: I love seeing them eat fruit - they get so hyped and it's so cute!\n[D25:23 | 8:16 pm on 25 October, 2022] Nate: Yeah, it's adorable! Watching them enjoy their favorite snacks is so fun. I also like holding them.\n[D28:31 | 5:54 pm on 9 November, 2022] Nate: Sounds good. Well I'll make sure I give the turtles a bath before you get here so they're ready to play.","itemId":"urn:uuid:7f8a68a8-c8f6-5565-954e-dae12c2cca2a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:eec67b85f82cd05ed4e5ad179ada529d6f165f06c68920f4700caf1ef246840a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What activities does Nate do with his turtles?","referenceAnswer":"takes them onwalks, holds them,feeds themstrawberries, givesthem baths.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"eec67b85f82cd05ed4e5ad179ada529d6f165f06c68920f4700caf1ef246840a"}}]}